  "reference_result": "607 cases per fixed32/64 profile; all605 committed observations unchanged;55 fixture hashes verified in each run. Two added cases verify typed-source ordering during and after repeated rollback, inherited private/override/static/virtual layout and untouched lazy state.",
  "test_first": {
    "command": "CGO_ENABLED=0 PHEGO_W13_REFERENCE=/tmp/phego-w13-r8-final-reference go test ./internal/runtime -run '^TestW13(R8PHP8512Regression|PHP8512Objects)$' -count=1",
    "before_result": "pass before production refactor; performance defect reproduced by before benchmark, not a semantic mismatch",
    "fixture_correction": "Initial observer ReflectionProperty::isInitialized on untouched lazy private slot invoked a third initializer and threw. Restricted two-pin instrumented trace located failure in result observation, after both rollback attempts. Replace with noninitializing isLazy and Go internal undefined invariant; no production behavior changed or expected result weakened. Initial failure and traced source retained.",
    "compile_correction": "Removing unique production attachPropertySource consumer also broke five R5 test-only seeding consumers. Preserve identical helper body/name/signature in object_model_test.go; no production rescan. Final R5/R8/full607 passed."
  },
  "architecture": {
    "root_cause": "restoreLazyProperties called attachPropertySource for every restored reference; helper rescanned entire schema each time, including untyped references with no source to attach.",
    "selected": "Traverse immutable class.schema.props once in original order, skipping static/virtual, pairing a monotonically increasing physical index with declared slots. buildClass produces exactly this filtered order. Preserve each detach -> old release/callback -> snapshot ownership transfer -> known typed descriptor attach sequence. No new metadata/index/map or public API change. Nil schema has no declared slots and remains guarded.",
    "alternatives": [
      "Per-slot schema rescan is avoidably quadratic.",
      "Name lookup/index adds redundant hashes; known descriptor and filtered physical order suffice.",
      "Batch detach/reattach changes callbacks typed-source ordering.",
      "Cache/extra schema map adds state with no benefit."
    ],
    "same_or_less_cost_improvements": [
      "Single methodHold value replaces one-element escaping slice in initializeLazy; capture original zero count before retain and preserve release -> running=false -> error/out order.",
      "Remove production-only-unused scan helper; retain unchanged test-only seeding adapter for existing R5 fixtures."
    ],
    "scope_limit": "Only the repeated schema-search factor is removed. Snapshot/default work, source-list identity/removal and callback work retain existing costs; arbitrary shared-source graphs are not claimed globally linear."
  },
  "baseline_overlay": {
    "revision": "76c70cb42950eaaea4c34c755f3ac105f2e71f32",
    "recipe": "git show revision:internal/runtime/object_lazy.go into overlay file; current object_model_test.go with only the moved attachPropertySource comment/function removed into second overlay file to avoid duplicate declaration. All other current sources/tests607 unchanged. Go overlay Replace maps the two absolute repository paths to those files.",
    "replay_command": "CGO_ENABLED=0 go test -overlay OVERLAY ./internal/runtime -run '^TestW13(R8PHP8512Regression|PHP8512Objects)$' -count=1",
    "replay_result": "exit0, runtime0.662s; old production passes607 semantics and still has the measured performance defect."
  },
